                "title": "Connect an Okta SSO connector",
                "description": "The [Okta Single Sign-On (SSO)](https://www.okta.com/products/single-sign-on/) data connector enables seamless integration of Okta data into Microsoft Sentinel and Microsoft Defender for Identity by ingesting identity related information and event logs via Okta APIs. For Microsoft Sentinel it allows ingestion of event logs leveraging leverages Data Collection Rules (DCRs) with [ingestion-time transformations](https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/azure-monitor/logs/custom-logs-overview) to ensure efficient and structured data flow. For Microsoft Defender for Identity it allows ingestion of Okta users, groups, roles, and system logs to Microsoft Defender for Identity to provide comprehensive identity protection for Okta which includes identity posture, threat detection, investigation, and response for identity threats in your Okta environment.",
